 result←object clientwhere arg;tunits;mysize
 tunits←⊃##._supp.MyUnits object
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←object ⎕VGET⊂'_clientwhere'⍬ ⍝ We'll manage this directly, once set
 :Else
     arg←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: clientwhere'##.##.Error~##.##.IsNum arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: clientwhere'##.##.Error 1<≢⍴arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: clientwhere'##.##.Error~arg≢⍛∊0 4
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: clientwhere'##.##.Error∨/arg<0
     object._clientwhere←arg ⍝ Remember this
     :If 0=≢arg ⍝ We're resetting it to default
         ⍝ Force it to match the internal size on the screen and stay that way
         object._mdi ##.##.∆WS('Posn'(0 0))('Size'(object ##.##.∆WG'Size'))('Attach' ('Top' 'Left' 'Bottom' 'Right'))
     :Else
         ⍝ Set it to a specific size and quit resizing it automatically
         object._mdi ##.##.∆WS('Posn'(tunits×2↑arg))('Size'(tunits×2↓arg))('Attach' ('None' 'None' 'None' 'None'))
     :EndIf
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
